    "correct": "D",
    "explanation": "Composing gives f(f(x)) = ((a² + b)x + ab − 2b)/((a − 2)x + b + 4). For this to equal x on its domain, comparison with x times the denominator forces the x² coefficient a − 2 to be zero. Hence a = 2. A nonconstant function also requires b ≠ −4; then the composition reduces to x wherever defined.",
